{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23566","headline":"泛太湖书事寄微之 · 白居易","name":"泛太湖书事寄微之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烟渚云帆处处通，飘然舟似入虚空。\n玉桮浅酌巡初匝，金管徐吹曲未终。\n黄夹缬林寒有叶，碧琉璃水净无风。\n避旗飞鹭翩翻白，惊鼓跳鱼拨剌红。\n涧雪压多松偃蹇，岩泉滴久石玲珑。\n书爲故事留湖上，吟作新诗寄浙东。\n军府威容从道盛，江山气色定知同。\n报君一事君应羡，五宿澄波皓月中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23566.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23566","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}